  "_lisez_moi": "Pre-detection settings (English build). Edit with Notepad. Words are written in CAPITALS, with or without accents. In 'attributs', 'libelle' is the internal (French) role name used by the engine: do not change it; 'affichage' is what the user sees; 'suffixe' builds the tag. Restart the program after editing.",
  "_ocr": "Reading scanned PDFs. \"tesseract\" is the path to the Tesseract program, \"tessdata\" the folder holding the language files (eng.traineddata). Leave both empty and the program will look for them in the usual places.",
  "ocr": {
    "tesseract": "",
    "tessdata": "",
    "langue": "eng",
    "resolution": 300
  },
