  "_parties_menu": "Parties offered in the menus (Party and Tag) without being produced by detection: the user picks them. \"numeros\": how many numbers are offered up front (COMPANY1 to COMPANY6). \"personne_physique\": true = shorter role menu (no company number, director, trade name, website). The \"*\" key applies to every type of document; the other keys are document types (contentieux, contrat...). Adding a line here is enough, without touching the program.",
